# Junkblade Bruiser: on turn one Sol Ring is mana 1 and the Bruiser mana 2-6, so its controller expends 4 while it is on
# the stack - it was not on the battlefield to see it (the expend rulings), and spending more that turn can't expend 4
# again. On turn three Black Lotus is free and Craw Wurm costs six: the fourth of them expends 4 (CR 700.14) and the
# Bruiser gets +2/+1 once - the fifth and sixth trigger nothing - then it is 4/5 again on the opponent's turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Sol Ring
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Lotus Petal
Junkblade Bruiser
Black Lotus
Craw Wurm
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

